OL,3,GNEWSADangerous driving arrest over
OL,4,Awoman's crash death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fcausing death by dangerous driving
OL,8,Fafter a woman died in a crash.
OL,10,FA black Mazda crashed at the Alderley
OL,11,FRoundabout on the A34 Melrose Way, in
OL,12,FNether Alderley, Cheshire, at about
OL,13,F01:00 BST on Friday and the driver fled
OL,14,Fon foot, Cheshire Police said.
OL,16,FA 21-year-old woman, who was a
OL,17,Fpassenger in the back of the car, died
OL,18,Fat the scene. Two other passengers, a
OL,19,F34-year-old woman and a 36-year-old
OL,20,Fman, were taken to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
